{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22269","headline":"山雉 · 白居易","name":"山雉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五步一啄草，十步一饮水。\n适性遂其生，时哉山梁雉。\n梁上无罾缴，梁下无鹰鸇。\n雌雄与羣雏，皆得终天年。\n嗟嗟笼下鸡，及彼池中鴈。\n既有稻粱恩，必有牺牲患。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22269.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22269","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}